{
    "title": "Toonsutra: Webtoon & Comics",
    "description": "Your daily destination for comics, webtoons, and stories! Explore thousands of digital comics in English and local languages.\r\n\r\n<b>Read Anywhere, Anytime:</b>\r\n\r\n- Massive library of hit comics from global publishers\r\n- Support for multiple languages - Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, and Bahasa\r\n- New episodes updated daily\r\n- Download stories to read offline\r\n- Personalized reading recommendations\r\n- Auto-scroll for smooth reading experience\r\n\r\n<b>Free Comics & Daily Rewards:</b>\r\n\r\n- Hundreds of completely free comics and episodes\r\n- New free episodes released daily\r\n- Daily login rewards and bonus coins\r\n- Watch ads to instantly unlock premium episodes\r\n- Use coins to unlock any premium comic or episode\r\n- Free preview chapters for all series\r\n\r\n<b>Premium Experience:</b>\r\n\r\n- Unlimited access to entire comics library\r\n- Read all episodes without waiting\r\n- No ads for uninterrupted reading\r\n- Early access to new series and episodes\r\n- Exclusive premium-only content\r\n- Cancel anytime\r\n\r\n<b>Endless Stories to Explore:</b>\r\n\r\n- Action: BRZRKR, Something is Killing the Children\r\n- Romance: The Distance Between Us, First Love\r\n- Mythology: The Legend of Hanuman, 18 Days: The Mahabharat\r\n- Teen: Archie Comics, Scott Pilgrim\r\n- Crime: Criminal, Reckless\r\n- Horror & Thriller: The Boys, Dark Knights\r\n- Comedy: Green Gold, Alicia Souza's Comics\r\n- Plus hundreds more across every genre!\r\n\r\n<b>From World-Class Creators:</b>\r\nRead works from renowned storytellers including S. S. Rajamouli (Baahubali, RRR), Shekhar Kapur, Ed Brubaker, Garth Ennis, Grant Morrison, Deepak Chopra, and many more talented artists!\r\n\r\n<b>Perfect for Every Reader:</b>\r\n\r\n- Easy-to-use interface\r\n- Customizable reading settings\r\n- Bookmark favorite episodes\r\n- Track reading history\r\n- Get notified when new episodes release\r\n- Join community discussions\r\n- Rate and review stories\r\n\r\n<b>Connect With Us:</b>\r\n\r\n- Instagram/Threads: @toonsutraofficial\r\n- Twitter/X: @Toonsutra\r\n- Discord: discord.gg/YSzRw5hXH7\r\n- Website: toonsutra.com\r\n\r\nDownload now to start your reading adventure! New users get special welcome rewards!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Your daily destination for comics, webtoons, and stories! Explore thousands of digital comics in English and local languages.<br><br><b>Read Anywhere, Anytime:</b><br><br>- Massive library of hit comics from global publishers<br>- Support for multiple languages - Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, and Bahasa<br>- New episodes updated daily<br>- Download stories to read offline<br>- Personalized reading recommendations<br>- Auto-scroll for smooth reading experience<br><br><b>Free Comics &amp; Daily Rewards:</b><br><br>- Hundreds of completely free comics and episodes<br>- New free episodes released daily<br>- Daily login rewards and bonus coins<br>- Watch ads to instantly unlock premium episodes<br>- Use coins to unlock any premium comic or episode<br>- Free preview chapters for all series<br><br><b>Premium Experience:</b><br><br>- Unlimited access to entire comics library<br>- Read all episodes without waiting<br>- No ads for uninterrupted reading<br>- Early access to new series and episodes<br>- Exclusive premium-only content<br>- Cancel anytime<br><br><b>Endless Stories to Explore:</b><br><br>- Action: BRZRKR, Something is Killing the Children<br>- Romance: The Distance Between Us, First Love<br>- Mythology: The Legend of Hanuman, 18 Days: The Mahabharat<br>- Teen: Archie Comics, Scott Pilgrim<br>- Crime: Criminal, Reckless<br>- Horror &amp; Thriller: The Boys, Dark Knights<br>- Comedy: Green Gold, Alicia Souza&#39;s Comics<br>- Plus hundreds more across every genre!<br><br><b>From World-Class Creators:</b><br>Read works from renowned storytellers including S. S. Rajamouli (Baahubali, RRR), Shekhar Kapur, Ed Brubaker, Garth Ennis, Grant Morrison, Deepak Chopra, and many more talented artists!<br><br><b>Perfect for Every Reader:</b><br><br>- Easy-to-use interface<br>- Customizable reading settings<br>- Bookmark favorite episodes<br>- Track reading history<br>- Get notified when new episodes release<br>- Join community discussions<br>- Rate and review stories<br><br><b>Connect With Us:</b><br><br>- Instagram/Threads: @toonsutraofficial<br>- Twitter/X: @Toonsutra<br>- Discord: discord.gg/YSzRw5hXH7<br>- Website: toonsutra.com<br><br>Download now to start your reading adventure! New users get special welcome rewards!",
